  <p id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">衆數萬屯嶢柳愁思塠以距<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0011" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>遂大戰<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0015" ref="wbk_0hg_v5e">生</persName>親自陷陣殺<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0021" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>將<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0023" ref="3an_0vy_yzu">應誕</persName><persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0025" ref="p2w_899_b04">劉泓</persName>死傷千數<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0031" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>軍力戰<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0035" ref="wbk_0hg_v5e">生</persName>衆乃散<persName id="c-jinshu-098-huan-guanzhong-wyd:p001:m0039" ref="o0k_xjc_d5b">雄</persName>又與</p>
